      "tail": 0.35,
      "min": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "lines": [
        "In two thousand one, the loan paid for a test: move families out of three Arctic places. Norilsk, Vorkuta, and Susuman."
      ],
      "music": "tension",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "type": "whoosh",
          "at": 0.05,
          "duration": 0.6,
          "gain": 0.25
